            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A highly specialized experimental treatment was used in the therapy of Herpes zoster, which was aimed at inducing good control over acute pain and the prevention of post herpic neuritis using poly-pharmacologic al infiltration of ganglia and of relevant roots.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
